art Next to the Toilet</a></li></ul></li><li><a class="kb-table-of-contents__entry" href="#wallmounted-over-the-toilet-storage-ideas">Wall-Mounted Over the Toilet Storage Ideas</a><ul class="kb-table-of-contents-list-sub"><li><a class="kb-table-of-contents__entry" href="#8-two-or-three-floating-shelves">8. Two or Three Floating Shelves</a></li><li><a class="kb-table-of-contents__entry" href="#9-a-wall-cabinet-with-doors">9. A Wall Cabinet with Doors</a></li><li><a class="kb-table-of-contents__entry" href="#10-an-overthetoilet-medicine-cabinet">10. An Over-the-Toilet Medicine Cabinet</a></li><li><a class="kb-table-of-contents__entry" href="#11-a-cabinet-plus-one-open-shelf">11. A Cabinet Plus One Open Shelf</a></li><li><a class="kb-table-of-contents__entry" href="#12-a-wall-grid-or-pegboard">12. A Wall Grid or Pegboard</a></li><li><a class="kb-table-of-contents__entry" href="#13-wallmounted-towel-storage">13. Wall-Mounted Towel Storage</a></li></ul></li><li><a class="kb-table-of-contents__entry" href="#how-to-style-and-organize-overthetoilet-shelves">How to Style and Organize Over-the-Toilet Shelves</a><ul class="kb-table-of-contents-list-sub"><li><a class="kb-table-of-contents__entry" href="#14-use-matching-baskets">14. Use Matching Baskets</a></li><li><a class="kb-table-of-contents__entry" href="#15-decant-into-clear-jars">15. Decant into Clear Jars</a></li><li><a class="kb-table-of-contents__entry" href="#16-roll-towels-instead-of-folding-them">16. Roll Towels Instead of Folding Them</a></li><li><a class="kb-table-of-contents__entry" href="#17-keep-heavy-items-low">17. Keep Heavy Items Low</a></li><li><a class="kb-table-of-contents__entry" href="#18-add-one-living-thing">18. Add One Living Thing</a></li></ul></li><li><a class="kb-table-of-contents__entry" href="#what-to-store-above-the-toilet-and-what-not-to">What to Store Above the Toilet (and What Not To)</a></li><li><a class="kb-table-of-contents__entry" href="#common-mistakes-to-avoid">Common Mistakes to Avoid